    <td style="width: 24px"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The trading market for our Class&#160;A ordinary shares is very new, and consistently robust and liquid trading market may not develop or be sustained over the long term. </span></td></tr>
