</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The National Securities Markets
Improvement Act&#160;of&#160;1996, which is a federal statute, prevents or preempts the states from regulating the sale of certain securities,
