</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Zhibao
Technology Inc. is a Cayman Islands exempted company incorporated on January&#160;11, 2023. Structured as a holding company with no material
operations, Zhibao conducts its operations in China through its PRC Subsidiaries, primarily Zhibao China and Sunshine Insurance Brokers.</span>&#160;&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Zhibao China, previously
known as Shanghai Julai Investment Management Co., Ltd. and Zhibao Technology (Shanghai) Co., Ltd., successively, started its business
in the insurance brokerage industry since 2016 in China. With the growth of our business and in order to facilitate international capital
investment in us, we started a reorganization as described below involving new offshore and onshore entities in December&#160;2022 and
completed it in March&#160;2023.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Zhibao BVI, incorporated
on January&#160;12, 2023 under the laws of British Virgin Islands, is our wholly-owned&#160;subsidiary in BVI and a holding company with
no business operations, which, in turn, wholly owns all of the equity interest of Zhibao HK, a limited company incorporated on January&#160;19,
2023 under the laws of Hong&#160;Kong.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"></p><div>

