</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On December 11, 2024, pursuant to the terms of the L1 Securities Purchase
Agreement and the December 2024 Letter Agreement, the Company and L1 consummated the third closing of the first tranche (the &#8220;<b>L1
