the L1 Second Tranche Note, and (ii) a warrant to purchase up to 291,193 Class A ordinary shares at an as-adjusted exercise price of $1.18172
per share (as adjusted from 202,459 Class&#160;A ordinary shares when initially issued on February 14, 2025, such warrants, the &#8220;<b>L1
First Closing of Second Tranche Warrant</b>&#8221;), subject to certain adjustments. In connection with the consummation of the L1 First
