    <td style="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Experienced Management Team with Extensive Expertise in Insurance Industry and Digital Technology</i></b></span></td></tr>
