digital insurance solutions on Zhibao China Group&#8217;s platform, which covers various scenarios in a variety of industries. We will
keep refining and upgrading our insurance solutions to keep abreast of new trends and customer preferences. In addition to optimizing
our existing insurance solutions, we are developing new insurance solutions to meet emerging demands. We intend to develop solutions across
every sector of the economy, thus ultimately covering every aspect of the end customers&#8217; daily life to deliver all-around insurance
coverage.</p><div>
