    <td style="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Insurance Product Design and Customization: we customize and design bespoke insurance products, including insurance coverage, premium price, and service offerings that cater to the specific business nature of our B channels and the needs of their end customers.</span></td></tr>
