</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Our revenue increased by RMB 41.6 million (US$5.7 million), or 29%
from approximately RMB 142.1&#160;million for the fiscal year ended June&#160;30, 2023 to RMB 183.7 million for the fiscal year ended
June 30, 2024, and further increased by RMB 93.3 million (US$13.3 million), or 51% to RMB 276.9 million (US$38.7 million) for the fiscal
