</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">For the fiscal year ended
June&#160;30, 2023, we incurred net loss of approximately RMB 43.1&#160;million, respectively. For the fiscal year ended June 30, 2024,
