</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Our
                                            revenues consist of (i)&#160;Insurance Brokerage Fees Zhibao China Group receive from their
                                            digital insurance brokerage services, and (ii)&#160;MGU Service Fees Zhibao China Group receive
                                            from insurance companies for MGU services. For the fiscal&#160;years ended June&#160;30,
