</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Zhibao
Labuan is incorporated in Malaysia and is subject to Malaysia Corporate Income Tax imposed on income accruing in or derived from Malaysia.
Zhibao Labuan is subject to the standard corporate tax rate of 24% if in a taxable position. However, resident companies that qualify
as small and medium-sized enterprises may benefit from a reduced tax rate of 15% on the first RM 150,000 of chargeable income and 17%
on the next RM 450,000.&#160;</span></p><div>

