the fiscal year ended June 30, 2023 to approximately RMB 15.1&#160;million (US$2.1&#160;million) for the fiscal year ended June 30, 2024.
The increase was mainly due to an increase of outsourcing expenses for the development of our platform.&#160;&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 7pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

