</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">For details of quantitative
information regarding Level 3 fair value measurements inputs for the Company&#8217;s derivate liabilities at their measurement dates,
please see <i>Note 10 &#8211; Convertible Note</i> to the consolidated financial statements.</p><div>

