</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">In addition to consolidated
U.S.&#160;GAAP financial measures, we consistently evaluate our use of and calculation of the non-GAAP financial measures, &#8220;Adjusted
