April&#160;1, 2022, Mr.&#160;Xiao Luo and Sunshine Insurance Brokers entered into a labor contract. Pursuant to the labor contract, Mr.&#160;Luo
serves as general manager of the Company for an indefinite term, commencing on April&#160;1, 2022, subject to certain conditions for
termination and certain exceptions provided under the PRC Labor Contract Law. Mr.&#160;Luo is entitled to a fixed base salary in the
amount of RMB45,000 ($6,400) per month plus subsidies and bonus. Mr.&#160;Luo is also entitled to participate in any benefit plans stipulated
by both parties or required by the PRC laws. This labor contract also contains customary restrictive covenants relating to non-competition
for a period of two&#160;years from the date of termination of employment and non-solicitation within one year after the termination
of the employment, confidentiality covenants restricting disclosures of the trade secrets and other confidential information until those
information becomes public, as well as certain liabilities due to his breach of contract.</span></p><div>

