</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The Company&#8217;s operations
are carried out in China. Accordingly, the Company&#8217;s business, financial condition and results of operations may be influenced by
the political, economic and legal environments in the PRC as well as by the general state of the PRC&#8217;s economy. In addition, the
Company&#8217;s business may be influenced by changes in governmental policies with respect to laws and regulations, anti-inflationary
measures, currency conversion and remittance abroad, rates and methods of taxation among other factors.</p><div>

