</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Our board of directors has
determined that Armando Baez, our independent director (under the standards set forth in Nasdaq Stock Market Rule 5605(a)(2) and Rule
10A-3 under the Exchange Act) and members of our audit committee, is an audit committee financial expert.</p><div>

