over-allotment option in connection with the Company&#8217;s initial public offering at $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c65" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-29221">4.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, resulting in additional gross
proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c66" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceInitialPublicOffering" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-29222">95,060</ix:nonFraction>.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

