</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="zbao_WarrantLiabilitiesTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="zbao:WarrantLiabilitiesTextBlock" id="ixv-25226"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>12 &#8212;&#160;WARRANT LIABILITIES</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">In connection with convertible
notes (Note 11), the Company issued Purchase Warrants to the Holder to purchase up to&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c286" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-29647">74,451</ix:nonFraction>&#160;Class A ordinary shares,&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c287" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConversionOfStockSharesIssued1" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-29648">79,599</ix:nonFraction>&#160;Class
A ordinary shares,&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c288" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConversionOfStockSharesIssued1" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-29649">160,020</ix:nonFraction>&#160;Class A ordinary shares and &#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c70" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConversionOfStockSharesIssued1" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-29650">202,459</ix:nonFraction>&#160;Class A ordinary shares, respectively, in the First
Closing of First Tranche, Second Closing of First Tranche, Third Closing of First Tranche and First Closing of Second Tranche. Each of
the Purchase Warrants will mature on the fifth anniversary since its issuance.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="zbao:ScheduleOfExercisePriceForEachPurchaseWarrantsTableTextBlock" id="ixv-25232"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The exercise price for each
Purchase Warrants were as the following:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

